msgid "Keyboard shortcuts and settings templates"
msgstr "键盘快捷键与设置模板"

msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "键盘短片"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "With the default bindings, press **F1** to open the shortcut cheat sheet. **?** opens it when the current screen does not handle that key itself; Annotate uses **?** for its inline key legend. The cheat sheet lists the keys that work anywhere in the window, such as **Ctrl+K** for the command palette, **Ctrl+P** for Preferences, **Ctrl+F** to search the current module's settings and **F11** for full screen, followed by the keys of the screen you are on."
msgstr "使用默认按键绑定时，按 **F1** 打开快捷键速查表。如果当前界面不自行处理该按键，**?** 也会打开速查表；Annotate 使用 **?** 显示其内嵌按键图例。 速查表列出在窗口任何位置都有效的按键，例如 **Ctrl+K** 打开命令面板、**Ctrl+P** 打开偏好设置、**Ctrl+F** 搜索当前模块的设置、**F11** 切换全屏，随后列出您所在屏幕的按键。"

# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "To change a key, choose **Change shortcuts…** in the cheat sheet. The **Change shortcuts** window has one row per action, with its **Default** key and the **Shortcut** in use. Click a shortcut and press the new key, or clear it to leave the action without a key. **Restore defaults** puts every row back to its default key."
msgstr "如需更改按键，请在速查表中选择 **更改快捷键…**。**更改快捷键** 窗口中每个操作占一行，显示其 **默认** 按键和正在使用的 **快捷键**。单击某个快捷键并按下新按键，或将其清除，使该操作不绑定按键。**恢复默认值** 会将每一行恢复为默认按键。"

# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "If a key is already used by another action that is active at the same time, the line under the table names the actions that share it, and **Save** stays unavailable until the conflict is resolved. Saved keys apply straight away, also to the matching menu items, and the cheat sheet shows them. They are kept with your preferences and read the same on Linux, macOS and Windows."
msgstr "如果某个按键已被同时处于活动状态的另一个操作占用，表格下方的一行会列出共用该按键的操作，并且在冲突解决之前 **保存** 保持不可用。保存的按键会立即生效，也适用于对应的菜单项，速查表也会显示它们。它们与您的偏好设置一起保存，在 Linux、macOS 和 Windows 上读取方式相同。"

# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Keys that belong to one screen, such as Annotate's labelling keys, the Make Masks editing keys and the field browser's keys, have their own rows, with the screen named in the **Scope** column. A screen key may match a key of another screen, but not a window-wide key or another key on the same screen. Changed screen keys apply at once to screens that are open and to screens opened later, and the screen's key legend shows them."
msgstr "属于某个屏幕的按键，例如 Annotate 的标注按键、Make Masks 的编辑按键以及视野浏览器的按键，各有独立的行，并在 **范围** 列中注明所属屏幕。屏幕按键可以与其他屏幕的按键相同，但不能与全窗口按键或同一屏幕上的其他按键相同。更改后的屏幕按键会立即应用于已打开的屏幕和之后打开的屏幕，屏幕的按键图例也会显示它们。"

msgid "Settings templates"
msgstr "设置模板"

msgid "A settings template is one module's settings saved under a name you choose, for example ``Toxo PVM, 40x``. Open a module with a settings panel and press **Ctrl+Shift+R** to open **Settings templates** for that module."
msgstr "设置模板是以您选择的名称保存的单个模块设置，例如 ``Toxo PVM, 40x``。打开带有设置面板的模块，按 **Ctrl+Shift+R** 即可打开该模块的 **设置模板**。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Save current settings…** stores the form as a named template, selects it in the list and shows its full saved path as text you can select and copy. Saving with an existing template name replaces that module's saved template."
msgstr "**保存当前设置…** 将表单保存为命名模板，在列表中选中它，并将完整保存路径显示为可选择和复制的文本。使用现有模板名称保存时，会替换该模块已保存的同名模板。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Apply** fills the form from the selected template. A template saved with another spaCR version requires confirmation. The compatibility message lists saved settings that the current module no longer accepts and will ignore; it does not list settings added since the template was saved. A template for a different module is refused."
msgstr "**应用** 根据所选模板填充表单。使用其他 spaCR 版本保存的模板需要确认。兼容性消息会列出当前模块不再接受、将被忽略的已保存设置；它不会列出自模板保存以来新增的设置。其他模块的模板会被拒绝。"

msgid "**Share…** writes the template to a JSON file you can send to someone else."
msgstr "**分享...** 将模板写入一个 JSON 文件，您可以把它发送给其他人。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Import…** reads a shared template file, or a settings CSV such as the one every run writes beside its results. A CSV becomes a template named after the file and is associated with the current module, so open the matching module before importing it. A JSON template naming another module, or a file without settings, is refused."
msgstr "**导入…** 读取共享模板文件，或设置 CSV，例如每次运行写在结果旁的设置文件。CSV 会成为以文件名命名的模板，并与当前模块关联，因此请先打开匹配的模块再导入。指定其他模块的 JSON 模板或没有设置的文件会被拒绝。"

msgid "**Rename…** gives the selected template a new name. A name that another template of the module already uses is refused."
msgstr "**重命名…** 为所选模板指定新名称。该模块另一个模板已使用的名称会被拒绝。"

msgid "**Delete** removes the selected template."
msgstr "**删除** 移除所选模板。"

# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Export settings…** on a module screen saves the form as a settings CSV without running it; see :ref:`settings-files-from-the-gui`."
msgstr "模块屏幕上的 **导出设置…** 会将表单保存为设置 CSV，而不运行它；参见 :ref:`settings-files-from-the-gui`。"

msgid "Templates are stored in ``~/.spacr/recipes/<module>/``, one JSON file per template. Set the ``SPACR_RECIPE_DIR`` environment variable to keep them in another folder, for example a shared lab folder."
msgstr "模板保存在 ``~/.spacr/recipes/<module>/`` 中，每个模板一个 JSON 文件。设置环境变量 ``SPACR_RECIPE_DIR`` 可将它们保存在其他文件夹中，例如实验室共享文件夹。"

